NOTE ON SCOPE

This MIT licence covers the framework CODE in this repository only.

  - Evaluation datasets (CUAD, HotpotQA, CNN/DailyMail, TruthfulQA) are
    used under their own respective licences, recorded in the README.
  - Model weights are used under their own licences (MIT, Apache 2.0,
    Gemma terms, Llama community licence), recorded in the README.
  - The curated UK public-sector corpus in data/ukps/documents/ consists
    of GOV.UK and NHS material published under the Open Government
    Licence v3.0; per-document sources and licence records are in
    data/ukps/documents/INDEX.csv.
